    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on darwin1859-ch04-13: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.80";
    dc:description "Both variables are standard categorical traits and broad public compilations exist. Harmonization is manageable and a contemporary comparative test can directly confirm or refute the stated association.";
