    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Code growth form and sexual system across flowering plants and compare the frequency of dioecy or separate flowers in trees versus non-woody plants using phylogenetic regression. A robust positive tree effect supports the claim; no effect or a negative effect refutes it.";
