    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Regional sampling could obscure a global pattern.", "Sexual-system coverage is incomplete and terminology varies.";
